# ── SECRETS — never commit, this repository is public ────────────────────────
# server-stack/.env holds the auth-token signing key, the uid encryption key,
# the DB password, the ROOT bot secret, the admin secret and the VAPID private
# key. Leaking any of them lets anyone mint valid login tokens.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
*.env
# `.env.prod` matched NONE of the rules above: `*.env` needs the name to END in
# `.env`, and this one ends in `.prod`. The production file — the one holding
# the real keys — was the single most dangerous name in the project and the only
# one not covered. Anything after `.env.` is now ignored, and the three example
# files are re-admitted below.
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.local.example
!.env.prod.example

# ── User data ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Postgres dumps (password hashes, private messages) and uploaded media.
_backup/

# ── The superseded anoon project (Supabase stack) ────────────────────────────
# Already has its own history on GitHub; kept locally for reference only.
_archive/

# ── Dependencies & build output ──────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
.next/
out/
build/
dist/
*.tsbuildinfo

# ── Vendored binaries (100 MB+, re-downloadable) ─────────────────────────────
server-stack/bin/*.exe
server/*.exe
*.exe

# ── Test & tooling artefacts ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
test-results/
playwright-report/
playwright/.cache/
qa-shots/
qa-shots-chat/
.playwright-mcp/
graphify-out/
# Expo web export — built on demand for the mobile e2e project (tests/e2e/mobile),
# 20+ MB of bundle that must never land in a commit.
.expo-web/

# ── Local tooling state ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.gstack/
.vercel/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log

# Disabled nested repos (renamed so their files commit as plain source)
*.git.disabled/
